Scope note

This licence covers the written analysis, the dashboard documentation and the
report contained in this repository.

It does not extend to the underlying course material. NovaTech Solutions is a
fictional company; the three source datasets (CRM deals, marketing campaigns,
support tickets) are course materials and are not included or redistributed
here, in whole or in part. Only schemas, row counts and derived figures appear
in the documents and screenshots.

Amazon Quick Suite, Amazon QuickSight and the Udacity programme are the property
of their respective owners. This repository is an independent portfolio record
of work produced during that programme.
